        "id": "mlir-talk-2023-02-09-deep-dive-on-mlir-internals-operation-attribute-towards-properties-slides",
        "title": "Deep Dive on MLIR Internals, Operation&Attribute, towards Properties",
        "abstract": "In this presentation, Mehdi AMINI will introduce some of the nitty-gritty aspects of MLIR internal core data-structures. If you ever wondered what happens when you create an Operation or an Attribute in MLIR, this may be interesting! Then we introduce Operation Properties as a new concept to potentially replace inherent Attributes on Operation. More info on Discourse: https://discourse.llvm.org/t/open-mlir-meeting-2-9-2023-deep-dive-on-mlir-internals-operation-attribute-towards-properties/68297",
